  geometric bisection. A solve that does not converge returns a node of the bisection's bracket instead of a
  volatility. On the \cmCensIvDays{} days of $\mathcal T_{\mathrm{opt}}$ on which a leg carries such a node, the
  implied volatility of the package is recovered by inverting its Black--Scholes value at the mid-quote, as in
  Section~\ref{sec:rh_econ_strategy}; no day is left without an implied volatility. The 16:00 stamp is not used.
